  "instance_name": "audience_id",
  "label": "audience description",
  "description": "The target audience is individuals who may find humor in mocking or ridiculing people with physical disabilities, particularly those who do not smile due to hip pain. The meme leverages Kevin Hart’s public persona as a recognizable figure to amplify its message, likely appealing to an audience that enjoys or is familiar with internet memes that use public figures to deliver derogatory stereotypes. The audience is likely to be those who are not directly affected by ableism or disability stigma, and who may not be aware of or insensitive to the harmful implications of the stereotype being portrayed. The meme’s intent to degrade people with disabilities suggests the target audience is not part of the disabled community, but rather individuals who may be entertained by or indifferent to the degrading portrayal of disability.",
